expression: out
---
MAC address utilities (generate random, look up vendor OUI)

Usage: ubertool mac [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  new     Generate a random locally-administered MAC address
  lookup  Look up the vendor for a MAC address from the bundled OUI table
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Output as JSON to stdout. Human messages still go to stderr
  -q, --quiet    Bare values only (pipe-friendly)
  -v, --verbose  Verbose progress to stderr
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
